  "description": {
    "en": "Playful design with purpose: storytelling, interaction and brand love for the next generation.\n\nYOLO, a Venezuelan yogurt brand, launched a new product line for kids, and I was entrusted with part of the PR package and branded merchandise. YOLO's new kids' line needed more than packaging: it needed a universe. I designed a coloring book that introduces the brand's characters and values through interactive storytelling; a sticker set made for play and collecting; a memory card game that turns brand elements into tactile, repeatable moments of joy; and 'glorificadores', countertop displays that lift the product in store.\n\nVibrant colors meet soft, friendly shapes and warm, whimsical illustration. Every piece was designed to feel like a gift, not a marketing tool.\n\nTimeframe: 5 days · Tools: Illustrator, Photoshop"
  },
